{
  "$comment": "Input for build-templates.ts. Landmarks come from detect_landmarks.py on the example photo. swapSides fixes photos where the detector reads a front-facing figure as back-facing (the mannequins have no face). keep lists the joints to score; override replaces detected angles that are unreliable.",
  "defaults": { "tolerance": 20 },
